WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.816
Use this slide as practice Work in small steps
predict the result and explain

00:00:05.829 --> 00:00:11.446
why your result makes sense Does the function name
describe the task

00:00:12.383 --> 00:00:19.403
Are parameters clear and necessary Is the body
focused on one job Does

00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:25.301
the function return a reusable value when needed
Does it handle predictable problems

00:00:26.235 --> 00:00:28.709
Would a future reader understand its purpose
